        "created_at": "2023-12-08T21:59:00.455Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Odds on the next cover featuring green? Adam’s used it in the last four episodes. Maybe least prominent in the Prime Wardens trade dress, but it’s still there. I know they’ve already recorded the Alt-F5 (shortcut unknown?) episode, but no one’s gotten a sneak peek at the art yet, have they?</p>",
