      {
        "id": 255773,
        "name": "Trajector",
        "username": "Trajector",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/{size}/1914_2.png",
        "created_at": "2023-12-08T22:14:48.149Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I enjoyed this episode a lot! It was really cool to see how these characters have evolved and how they play off each other. Adam was on point throwing twists into the story.</p>\n<p>I loved the bit where Expatriette tells Legacy, “You can’t do this without a <em>plan!</em>” It removed me of the first season of the CW’s Flash where Oliver is training Barry, and setting traps around to get him to not just run full speed into an attack. Probably doesn’t work as well when you have bulletproof skin, though!</p>\n<p>The bit about Legacy’s reaction to the team-up is excellent, and Senator Parsons’ response is even better. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/grin.png?v=12\" title=\":grin:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":grin:\"></p>\n<p>Congratulations to the happy listeners!</p>",
        "post_number": 25,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2023-12-08T22:14:48.149Z",
        "reply_count": 1,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
