      {
        "id": 265070,
        "name": "",
        "username": "LonelyMan",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/f4b2a3/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2026-02-10T17:36:55.865Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Didn’t have anything worth saying until right before the cover section, but holy hannah, what a lore drop right at the end there.  The Central Plane is the existential domain of Hope?  Easily one of the coolest ideas in fictional history.  DC has a character that’s synonymous with hope (plus a corps of Lanterns, but that’s  nowhere near as iconic).  But only Sentinels has an entire <em>universe</em> for it.  I’m so jazzed.</p>",
